8,Fuyug – TIPs,https://tips.translation.bible/tip_language/fuy/,"Trans-New Guinea > Southeast Papuan > Goilalan > Fuyug.Fuyug has no passive voice, so it was necessary to say who baptized Saul in Acts 9:18. The only possible agent in the text is Ananias, so he was specified.",Fuyug,Trans-New Guinea
